{"unit_id":"orangeofcarl0-sys__dsh-fresh-start#card-zh","repo":"orangeofcarl0-sys/dsh-fresh-start","commit":"1b8f89d25cf39cb8957fefc386d6ac3df1100eb9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fresh-start 是面向 DSH Web 的会话管理插件，提供 /fresh 命令，将当前对话整理后接续到新会话。它会先尝试调用宿主压缩服务，再把当前上下文交给配置的模型生成摘要；随后创建带摘要种子的会话，继承工作目录和 agent preset，并归档旧会话。浏览器端会在归档后按父会话关系自动打开新会话，列表同步较慢时会等待后补跳。用户可选择不同 preset，也可沿用当前 preset；适合长对话收尾和继续工作的场景。无需插件专属密钥或额外配置，摘要使用会话当前模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-139","lib/index.js:142-188","lib/index.js:269-297","lib/index.js:300-377","lib/client.js:34-69"]}
{"unit_id":"orangeofcarl0-sys__dsh-fresh-start#card-en","repo":"orangeofcarl0-sys/dsh-fresh-start","commit":"1b8f89d25cf39cb8957fefc386d6ac3df1100eb9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fresh-start adds /fresh to DSH Web. It can compact context, ask the current model for a summary, create a seeded session, archive the old session, and open the new one in the browser. Choose or inherit a preset; no plugin-specific key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-139","lib/index.js:142-188","lib/index.js:269-297","lib/index.js:300-377","lib/client.js:34-69"]}
