{"unit_id":"orangeofcarl0-sys__dsh-fresh-start#feature-1","repo":"orangeofcarl0-sys/dsh-fresh-start","commit":"1b8f89d25cf39cb8957fefc386d6ac3df1100eb9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fresh-start 的「总结并接续会话」功能：输入 /fresh 后从当前会话上下文生成摘要，并将摘要作为新会话的开场内容；摘要失败时仍可继续创建会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:142-188","lib/index.js:326-336"]}
