{"unit_id":"orangeofcarl0-sys__dsh-fresh-start#caveat-1","repo":"orangeofcarl0-sys/dsh-fresh-start","commit":"1b8f89d25cf39cb8957fefc386d6ac3df1100eb9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fresh-start 会把当前会话上下文发送给会话所用模型来生成摘要；若模型总结失败，仍会创建并归档会话，但新会话没有摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:142-188","lib/index.js:326-336"]}
